pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Boot to the title screen and quit (NN-2.5): the start translates every shader
# the device's pipeline storage names, which is what `pinyon.py android
# shader-pack` captures to build the device's SPIR-V pack. No input, no save.
# A route needs one capture before its stop frame.
# clock-hz 60
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 880 title
stop 900
